    "content": "# Frameworks & Tooling\n\nThe libraries, SDKs, and developer tools that make it easy to build AI applications.\n\n## Key Players\n\n- **LangChain** — LLM application framework\n- **LlamaIndex** — Data framework for RAG\n- **Semantic Kernel** — Microsoft AI orchestration\n- **Haystack** — Pipeline framework by deepset\n- **Dify** — Low-code AI app builder\n- **n8n** — Workflow automation with AI\n\n## Why It Matters\n\nFrameworks abstract away the complexity of connecting models, data, and tools. They determine how fast developers can ship AI products.",
