    "content": "# Governance, Safety & Policy\n\nThe research, regulation, and practices aimed at making AI safe, aligned, and beneficial.\n\n## Key Players\n\n- **Anthropic** — Constitutional AI, safety research\n- **OpenAI** — Safety team, red-teaming\n- **Google DeepMind** — Safety research\n- **MIRI** — Machine Intelligence Research Institute\n- **Partnership on AI** — Industry coalition\n- **EU AI Act** — Regulatory framework\n- **NIST AI RMF** — Risk management framework\n\n## Why It Matters\n\nAs AI becomes more capable, governance and safety determine whether it remains beneficial. This layer cuts across the entire stack.",
