    "content": "# Retrieval & Memory\n\nVector databases, embedding models, and RAG architectures that give AI systems access to external knowledge.\n\n## Key Players\n\n- **Pinecone** — Managed vector database\n- **Weaviate** — Open-source vector search\n- **Chroma** — Lightweight vector store\n- **Qdrant** — Vector similarity search\n- **pgvector** — PostgreSQL vector extension\n- **Cohere** — Embedding models + Rerank\n- **OpenAI** — text-embedding-3\n\n## Why It Matters\n\nRetrieval is how AI models access up-to-date, domain-specific information beyond their training data. RAG is the dominant pattern for production AI applications.",
